### PackPilot - packing-trip-service
### IntelliJ HTTP Client file. Needs a reachable MongoDB and a reachable
### packing-generator-service (see this service's README for how to run
### both locally). Requests below run top to bottom: the "Save a trip"
### request is named (# @name saveTrip), so later requests reuse the id
### from its response automatically. The item-level requests expect an
### item id copied from a previous response, replace @itemId below once
### you have one.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@itemId = replace-with-an-item-id-from-a-response-above

### Ask the generator service for a draft. Nothing is saved yet.
POST {{baseUrl}}/packing-lists/generate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "climate": "warm",
  "tripLengthDays": 4,
  "adults": 2,
  "activities": ["business"]
}

### Save a trip (using a draft you already have, or one typed by hand)
# @name saveTrip
POST {{baseUrl}}/packing-lists
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tripName": "Lisbon business trip",
  "climate": "warm",
  "tripLengthDays": 4,
  "adults": 2,
  "children": 0,
  "toddlers": 0,
  "activities": ["business"],
  "items": [
    { "category": "CLOTHING", "name": "Suit", "quantity": 1, "note": null },
    { "category": "ELECTRONICS", "name": "Laptop", "quantity": 1, "note": null }
  ]
}

### List all saved trips
GET {{baseUrl}}/packing-lists

### List saved trips filtered by climate
GET {{baseUrl}}/packing-lists?climate=warm

### Search saved trips by name
GET {{baseUrl}}/packing-lists?search=Lisbon

### Get the trip just saved above
GET {{baseUrl}}/packing-lists/{{saveTrip.response.body.$.id}}

### Rename the trip just saved above
PUT {{baseUrl}}/packing-lists/{{saveTrip.response.body.$.id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tripName": "Lisbon business trip (updated)"
}

### Add a custom item to the trip. Copy the new item's id from the
### response into @itemId above to use the two requests below.
POST {{baseUrl}}/packing-lists/{{saveTrip.response.body.$.id}}/items
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "category": "ELECTRONICS",
  "name": "Laptop charger",
  "quantity": 1,
  "note": null
}

### Check an item off, or change its quantity or note
PUT {{baseUrl}}/packing-lists/{{saveTrip.response.body.$.id}}/items/{{itemId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "checked": true
}

### Remove an item
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/packing-lists/{{saveTrip.response.body.$.id}}/items/{{itemId}}

### Delete the trip
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/packing-lists/{{saveTrip.response.body.$.id}}

### Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/health
